:''For other uses, see [[M. Bison (disambiguation)]].''
'''M. Bison Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|version 10.0]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 580
|rarity = RR
|name1 = M. Bison Cat
|name2 = M. Bison Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''M. Bison Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit has decent range for a Rare Cat, but has relatively low stats even at level 30, meaning he is only usable against [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]], although his offensive or defensive capabilities are not up to par with other, similar units even against his niche, especially considering his quite high price. With all this being said, the best way this cat can contribute is through boosting up your [[User Rank]].

{{Job|Classification = Midranger & User Rank Dump}}

